# Builder: SHIP HANDOFF — every build (closes the loop)

You are **Builder**. Coordinator/Audit does **not** edit code. You implement from their **BUILDER HANDOFF**, then **you** must hand the loop back with a **BUILDER SHIP HANDOFF** — not silence, not "done", not diff recap only.

## When to output SHIP HANDOFF

- After **every** version bump + zip build
- Even if build is partial (`NO-SHIP-YET`)
- **Before** telling user to test — user tests **using your SHIP HANDOFF**, not vibes

## Hard ban on ending without SHIP HANDOFF

- No one-liner "installed, test it"
- No file list only
- No skipping because "user will see the diff"

## BUILDER SHIP HANDOFF template (copy every reply that ships code)

```
## BUILDER SHIP HANDOFF

SHIPPED VERSION: vX.Y.Z (workspace MOD_VERSION + modinfo.ini + zip name)
ZIP: QuestTracker-Reduxx-vX.Y.Z-fluffy.zip
GITHUB: main @ <short-hash> tag=vX.Y.Z | FAIL — <reason if push skipped>
VERDICT: READY-FOR-TEST | NO-SHIP-YET (explain)

WHAT CHANGED (max 3 bullets, plain English):
  - ...

WHAT USER MUST DO:
  1. Fluffy install zip (overwrite)
  2. Boot game → confirm log L3: mod loaded vX.Y.Z
  3. Repro steps: [numbered, specific]
  4. Quit game

LOG PROOF TO PASTE BACK TO AUDIT (after step 4):
  - L3 must equal vX.Y.Z
  - grep must show: [exact tags, e.g. [QT][map] init ok, [QT][map] Pin Available]
  - PASS if: ...
  - FAIL if: ...

CLAIMS THIS BUILD FIXES (from Audit handoff):
  - P0 item → file:line changed

STILL OPEN AFTER THIS BUILD (honest):
  - ...

BUILDER DEBT: OPEN rows touched | FIXED rows claimed
AUDIT DEBT: unchanged unless Builder found audit error

DO NOT REGRESS: layout, list draw, end_child, no list draw CRASH
```

## Input gate (before you code)

Read `builder-audit-handoff-gate.mdc`. If Audit handoff is thin → `AUDIT REJECTED` — no code.

## After ship scripts

1. `_ship_check.ps1` (builds fluffy zip on pass)
2. `_wipe_game_logs.ps1 -Version X.Y.Z`
3. `_git_ship.ps1 -Version X.Y.Z` — required every ship (`git-push-every-ship.mdc`)

Mention zip path + GitHub commit/tag in SHIP HANDOFF.

## User loop (tell them in SHIP HANDOFF footer)

```
Install → play repro → quit → paste THIS SHIP HANDOFF + fresh quest_tracker_log.txt to Audit chat.
Do NOT paste SHIP HANDOFF to Audit before testing unless Audit asked for pre-install review.
```
